      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    ResultText: The lock clicks open. Whoever stashed this had good taste.
    FailText: The failsafe goes off in your face.
  - Label: Cut it open carefully
    Requirement: 0
    RequiredScraps: 20
    Chance: 1
